The Docker image derives from juaniwck/mister-retroarch-save-sync and uses
its conversion modules, which include save-file-converter by Euan Forrester.
The upstream image retains its own source modules and full license texts
at /app/LICENSE and /app/LICENSE.save-file-converter.

